{"data":{"body":"[P2] Restrict empty group-ID validation to FIFO queues\n\n`messageGroupId` is documented as ignored for standard queues, and `export()` omits it there. This unconditional check now rejects previously working standard-queue configurations containing `messageGroupId: \"\"`. Constructing the exporter at module scope can consequently prevent the Lambda handler from loading, although no invalid ID would be sent. Restrict this validation to FIFO queues and add a standard-queue regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABA1jzJw","finding_digest":"7e0585be7acc56f9f85827082413c1445fc3532ad6b01767c778a042a62c9285","finding_id":"arf_v1_pycylpt2zrlpt6cye4ecie6bir","finding_key":"telemetry-exporter::sqsexporter.constructor::standard-queue-ignores-message-group-id","identity_key":"telemetry-exporter::sqsexporter.constructor::standard-queue-ignores-message-group-id","line":67,"observation_digest":"18692edf461939f6d5ef75e9c3caad6aeb026df6f9e30982ef4a14eb355cf663","observation_id":"aro_v1_dbus5x2gde47nvppoxu4hsvnnl","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/exporters/sqs-exporter.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-22T16:56:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ngaw4pyrbvs3vhx2vtt52la7qw","reviewed_base_sha":"07519da35f636ea43a0c1971b3fc640e4cd77ac5","reviewed_head_sha":"772afe792097d413333cf03c119e66dfd04e82ae","reviewer":"codex","start_line":67,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_jgbwt2tvx53pwh5jnti5646jsq"},"pull_request":{"number":1052},"record_id":"art_v1_wev3wbtfuxpmkdniri64nfzabg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-22T16:56:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
